      1-       c ============================================================                  
      2-       c MCNP Model Description                                                        
      3-       c Annular Flow                                                                  
      4-       c Geometry represents a composite assembly with nested cylinders,               
      5-       c shielding layers, and an extended environment box.                            
      6-       c Photon transport mode (MODE P) is used.                                       
      7-       c A detailed source energy spectrum is defined (SI/SP cards).                   
      8-       c Includes detector tally (F8 pulse height) with GEB response.                  
      9-       c ============================================================                  
