     12-       C -------------------------                                                     
     13-       100 1 -7.87 -11 12 #(-13) imp:p=1                                               
     14-       c Steel region (material m1, density 7.87 g/cc), bounded by surfaces 11 and 12, 
     15-       c with void exclusion (#-13). Photon transport importance = 1.                  
     16-       101 2 -1e-06 -12 #(-27 28) imp:p=1                                              
